---

This software, titled **Gram Panchayat Expense Tracker**, is an open-source web application intended for transparency and basic expense tracking use-cases in local governance.

This project uses sample or demonstration data only. It is **not** connected to any official government database and should not be treated as an authoritative financial record.

Any deployment or reuse of this software in real-world governance systems must ensure compliance with applicable laws, data protection norms, and security practices.

